    {
      "title": "Saudi-backed forces recapture key areas around strait from Houthis in Yemen",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/05/saudi-forces-recapture-key-areas-strait-houthis-yemen",
      "description": "<p>Government offensive launched under air cover by Saudi military coalition aims to retake all Houthi-held territory</p><p>Forces of the Saudi-led coalition fighting in Yemen have recaptured several key areas around Bab al-Mandab strait from Iran-backed Houthi rebels, Yemeni officials said on Monday.</p><p>The officials said forces allied with the internationally recognized government have retaken the crucial town of Dhubab just north of the strait. They also captured the towns of Bab and Hadeid, said the officials, who spoke on condition of anonymity because they were not authorized to speak to reporters. Witnesses said they saw government tanks and forces entering the towns.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/05/saudi-forces-recapture-key-areas-strait-houthis-yemen\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-05T19:44:01"
    },
    {
      "title": "Air campaign against Houthis under way in Yemen, says Saudi-led coalition",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/05/yemen-air-campaign-houthis-saudi-led-coalition",
      "description": "<p>Operation supported by 100 fighter jets said to have secured ‘air protection’ of Bab al-Mandab strait and destroyed hundreds of targets</p><p>Leaders of a Saudi-led coalition in Yemen claimed a broad air campaign involving 100 jet aircraft was under way on Monday against the Iran-backed Houthi rebels along the Red Sea coastline and farther north in the capital, Sana’a.</p><p>The Saudi coalition spokesperson, Maj Gen Turki al-Maliki, said the 100 fighter jets participating in Operation Dawn of Yemen were providing support to forces of Yemen’s internationally recognised government.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/05/yemen-air-campaign-houthis-saudi-led-coalition\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-05T15:21:54"
    },
